<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head>
<body>
  <nav>
  <a href="/">Home</a>
  <a href="/about">About</a>
  <a href="/services">Services</a>
  <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
  <a href="/feedback">Feedback</a>
</nav>
  <main>
    <h1>Express + EJS Multi-Route Application</h1>
    <p>This application demonstrates 7 routes (both <strong>GET</strong> and <strong>POST</strong>) rendered with the <strong>EJS</strong> template engine.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>GET /</code> — Home page</li>
      <li><code>GET /about</code> — About page</li>
      <li><code>GET /services</code> — Dynamic services list</li>
      <li><code>GET /contact</code> &amp; <code>POST /contact</code> — Contact form</li>
      <li><code>GET /feedback</code> &amp; <code>POST /feedback</code> — Feedback board</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
